(6259401, 925855, 43088, '<td valign="top">I struggled with this on a couple others- is it on the inside looking out (as the child is) or is it us, the viewer, who is on the outside looking in? I have decided it is both. A well executed image.</td>', 'I struggled with this on a couple others- is it on the inside looking out (as the child is) or is it us, the viewer, who is on the outside looking in? I have decided it is both. A well executed image.', '2010-12-22 04:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
