(6259403, 925775, 43088, '<td valign="top">I like how you focused on the fence instead of the goats- and how you were able to frame the goats withing the openings of the fence.</td>', 'I like how you focused on the fence instead of the goats- and how you were able to frame the goats withing the openings of the fence.', '2010-12-22 04:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
