(6259422, 926062, 83544, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo and oddly looking photo. I like the atmosphere in the image and the diversity of colors. Fits challenge. 8</td>', 'An interesting photo and oddly looking photo. I like the atmosphere in the image and the diversity of colors. Fits challenge. 8', '2010-12-22 06:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
