(6259425, 926197, 83544, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been better that the photo wasn''t so centered on the 3 persons, because the view looking inside is what really matters for this challenge. Still a nice looking photo, 7</td>', 'I think it would have been better that the photo wasn''t so centered on the 3 persons, because the view looking inside is what really matters for this challenge. Still a nice looking photo, 7', '2010-12-22 06:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
