(6259438, 925849, 83544, '<td valign="top">Looks more of a snapshot, and the lighting isn''t much good, the TV in the background is little bit distracting because of the different color, but at least it fits the challenge. 5</td>', 'Looks more of a snapshot, and the lighting isn''t much good, the TV in the background is little bit distracting because of the different color, but at least it fits the challenge. 5', '2010-12-22 06:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
