(6259466, 925693, 83544, '<td valign="top">this photo can be seen in two ways...the view of the photographer who is inside of a tower and his view is half of the inside and half of the outside world and this would be a DNMC, but as the title says this photo can be partly accepted meaning the view of the kids looking into each other. Nevertheless I think you should read the details of the challenge. It is required to capture the view looking inside, not the viewer looking inside which means we can''t see the view which he''s looking at.</td>', 'this photo can be seen in two ways...the view of the photographer who is inside of a tower and his view is half of the inside and half of the outside world and this would be a DNMC, but as the title says this photo can be partly accepted meaning the view of the kids looking into each other. Nevertheless I think you should read the details of the challenge. It is required to capture the view looking inside, not the viewer looking inside which means we can''t see the view which he''s looking at.', '2010-12-22 07:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
