(6260391, 925900, 83313, '<td valign="top">Have to wonder what the heck is going on here. Homeless person napping? Guy tripped and you took a photo instead of helping him up? A buddy who posed there for your shot? Have to give extra pointage to anything that makes me stop to look and question more closely.</td>', 'Have to wonder what the heck is going on here. Homeless person napping? Guy tripped and you took a photo instead of helping him up? A buddy who posed there for your shot? Have to give extra pointage to anything that makes me stop to look and question more closely.', '2010-12-23 13:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260394, 926207, 83313, '<td valign="top">AWWWW!! He''s a chip off the old engine block!</td>', 'AWWWW!! He''s a chip off the old engine block!', '2010-12-23 13:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260541, 925343, 1908, '<td valign="top">Just out of focus but a great idea.</td>', 'Just out of focus but a great idea.', '2010-12-23 16:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260542, 926021, 40391, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful location that is well set up to meet the challenge.  What really grabs me is the great lighting and good deep DoF.  Little touches that also appeal are the snow on the ground and the fire hose reel that is seasonally red.  Oh, and the Coke bottle poster (the real origin of Santa?).</td>', 'This is a wonderful location that is well set up to meet the challenge.  What really grabs me is the great lighting and good deep DoF.  Little touches that also appeal are the snow on the ground and the fire hose reel that is seasonally red.  Oh, and the Coke bottle poster (the real origin of Santa?).', '2010-12-23 16:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260543, 926229, 40391, '<td valign="top">This really does look like a Chinese brush painting.  Im assuming the leaf is suspended in ice.  A lovely, intriguing image and one of my favourites for the challenge.</td>', 'This really does look like a Chinese brush painting.  Im assuming the leaf is suspended in ice.  A lovely, intriguing image and one of my favourites for the challenge.', '2010-12-23 17:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260544, 926124, 40391, '<td valign="top">Nicely spotted and captured!</td>', 'Nicely spotted and captured!', '2010-12-23 17:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260546, 926197, 40391, '<td valign="top">Hehe.  People often discuss the relevance of a title for a photograph.  I, for one, appreciate a good title but in this case it actually creates the story that helps me to appreciate the image even more.  Well done!</td>', 'Hehe.  People often discuss the relevance of a title for a photograph.  I, for one, appreciate a good title but in this case it actually creates the story that helps me to appreciate the image even more.  Well done!', '2010-12-23 17:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6260547, 925849, 40391, '<td valign="top">Christmas Evening  really?  Im going to have to get this photo checked by SC to ensure it was taken during the challenge period.  Oh, and can you please return the Tardis to the good Dr.<br/>;-)</td>', 'Christmas Evening  really?  Im going to have to get this photo checked by SC to ensure it was taken during the challenge period.  Oh, and can you please return the Tardis to the good Dr.;-)', '2010-12-23 17:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
