(6262861, 926207, 30861, '<td valign="top">Hiya Clark! Or Lil Clark. Or whatever this is. Is it a model? One had assumed it must be, if only for the lack of detailing on the seats, and the windshield wipers are weird, but at the same time the "flaws" seem oddly full-size-real, so wtf do I know, anyway? But Hiya Clark! We''ve missed you!</td>', 'Hiya Clark! Or Lil Clark. Or whatever this is. Is it a model? One had assumed it must be, if only for the lack of detailing on the seats, and the windshield wipers are weird, but at the same time the "flaws" seem oddly full-size-real, so wtf do I know, anyway? But Hiya Clark! We''ve missed you!', '2010-12-28 18:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
